+  // nodes Unserialize freed and which it created without notifying anyone.
+  // Starting over is simpler and leaves nothing stale: destroy every delegate
+  // (on Windows this disconnects its AXPlatformNodeWin, so COM references that
+  // assistive technology still holds return E_FAIL instead of reaching freed
